    "titre": "Terms of Use - Road Companion",
    "introduction": "These terms of use constitute an agreement between you and Road Companion regarding your use of the application.Important: By using this service, you confirm that you have read, understood, accepted, and agreed to these terms of use.",
    "conditions": [
      "The application is designed to help users find roadside assistance, mechanics, and spare part sellers based on their location.",
      "Service providers can register by providing details such as their name, location, and offered services. This data will be published and can be deleted upon request.",
